{"report_id":"xrjhl","is_trip_report":true,"reason":"Firsthand account of an intense experience with visual transformations of room, wife, and geometric patterns.","scenes":[{"place":"living room with TV, looking at ceiling","order":1,"light":["glowing","flamey glow"],"colour":["blue","green","red","yellow","beautiful red"],"motion":["dancing","scrolling","racing","immediate face changes","stretching, growing"],"geometry":["stamped plaster pattern","changing shapes"],"material":["LED-sign-like"],"density":[],"scale":["giant"],"beings":[{"form":["wife, glowing red, face old/young/long thin and alien"],"count_text":"my wife","behaviour":["tried to kiss me","face changing rapidly"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:wife, glowing red, face old/young/long thin and alien"],"behaviour":["other:tried to kiss me","other:face changing rapidly"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["coming down and talking for 10-15 minutes"],"affect":["amazement","overwhelmed sensation"],"quotes":[{"text":"My ceiling, with a stamped plaster pattern, had become a giant dance of colors – almost like a giant LED scrolling sign with shapes that changed, and moved, and were outlined by these racing colors of blue, green, red, yellow.","start":1225,"end":1451,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"And everywhere I looked, the walls seemed to dance.","start":1452,"end":1503,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"her face was changing – not morphing slowly, but immediate – from old, to young, to impossibly long, thin and alien","start":1580,"end":1695,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I laid back and watched her toes stretch and grow and glow like little flames.","start":1879,"end":1957,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"The first wave hit quickly","start":1109,"end":1135,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":["glowing","other:flamey glow"],"colour":["blue","green","red","yellow","other:beautiful red"],"motion":["other:dancing","other:scrolling","other:racing","other:immediate face changes","other:stretching, growing"],"geometry":["other:stamped plaster pattern","other:changing shapes"],"material":["other:LED-sign-like"],"density":[],"scale":["other:giant"],"affect":["other:amazement","other:overwhelmed sensation"],"transition_trigger":["other:coming down and talking for 10-15 minutes"],"place":"other:living room with TV, looking at ceiling"}},{"place":"same chair, new video playing (Africa footage)","order":2,"light":[],"colour":["dancing colors"],"motion":["rolling across","bleeding","free fall","opening and blinking"],"geometry":["very geometric","dot-matrix triangles in lines, perfectly spaced, perfectly curved"],"material":[],"density":["intense beyond words"],"scale":["center of the universe"],"beings":[{"form":["eyes everywhere"],"count_text":"eyes everywhere","behaviour":["opened and blinked around the details"],"communication":[],"affect":[],"normalised":{"form":["other:eyes everywhere"],"behaviour":["other:opened and blinked around the details"],"communication":[],"affect":[]}}],"transition_trigger":["came down breathing hard"],"affect":["frightening","exhilarating"],"quotes":[{"text":"I can remember seeing the patterns coming back on the ceiling, rolling across, and I said “It’s coming back!”","start":2597,"end":2706,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"It was like my wife and I were at the center of the universe and everything outside of the chair we were cuddled into was illusion, dancing colors, and one.","start":2799,"end":2955,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"these little dot-matrix triangles that in lines, perfectly spaced, but also perfectly curved along the forms in the video","start":3226,"end":3347,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"All I can say is that I remember seeing eyes everywhere, they opened and blinked around the details","start":3458,"end":3557,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false},{"text":"I came down breathing hard.","start":3586,"end":3613,"anchor_score":1.0,"weak_anchor":false,"redacted":false,"ambiguous_anchor":false}],"normalised":{"light":[],"colour":["other:dancing colors"],"motion":["other:rolling across","other:bleeding","other:free fall","other:opening and blinking"],"geometry":["other:very geometric","other:dot-matrix triangles in lines, perfectly spaced, perfectly curved"],"material":[],"density":["other:intense beyond words"],"scale":["other:center of the universe"],"affect":["other:frightening","other:exhilarating"],"transition_trigger":["other:came down breathing hard"],"place":"other:same chair, new video playing (Africa footage)"}}],"flags":["unmapped:/scenes/0/light","unmapped:/scenes/0/colour","unmapped:/scenes/0/motion","unmapped:/scenes/0/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/0/material","unmapped:/scenes/0/scale","unmapped:/scenes/0/affect","unmapped:/scenes/0/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/0/place","unmapped:/scenes/0/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/0/beings/0/behaviour","unmapped:/scenes/1/colour","unmapped:/scenes/1/motion","unmapped:/scenes/1/geometry","unmapped:/scenes/1/density","unmapped:/scenes/1/scale","unmapped:/scenes/1/affect","unmapped:/scenes/1/transition_trigger","unmapped:/scenes/1/place","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/form","unmapped:/scenes/1/beings/0/behaviour"],"schema_version":"0.4.0","_extraction":{"job":"batch-8853d340cff144ebb9afcb5a9dc05820","phase":"pilot20","attempt":11}}
